% covers: 1 - nested calls, the third member of the deep-nesting family
% 50,000 levels rather than 200,000: a call level costs more stack than a
% parenthesis, so this already aborts today, and the file stays a quarter
% the size. The evaluator recurses here as well as the parser, so this is
% the case that proves both limits are in place.
